{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000003830","bookName":"Pedazos de nuestro amor","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000003830/42000003830.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":815050,"followCount":12242,"introduction":"Dante, quien sobrevivió a un ataque en su infancia que terminó con la vida de sus padres, crece para unirse a la equipo de rescate y se casa con Victoria. Él empieza a inquietarse cuando ella se acerca de forma inusual al hijo adoptivo que tienen y a su padre, y su indiferencia eventual termina por separarlos. Cuando Dante regresa a su familia, su tío planea asesinarlo—pero Victoria arriesga su vida para protegerlo, confesando su amor y su arrepentimiento en sus brazos.","chapterCount":64,"labels":["Winning Him Back","Family Bonds"],"tags":["Winning Him Back","Family Bonds"],"typeTwoIds":[303],"typeTwoNames":["Urbano"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":303,"name":"Urbano","replaceName":"urbano"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Urbano","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Pedazos-de-nuestro-amor","bookNameLower":"pedazos-de-nuestro-amor","shelfTime":"2026-01-14 17:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2026-01-14 17:00:00","performerIdList":[]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700237943","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/34/0x3/03x8/038x3/03830000024/700237943_1/700237943.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795132800&Signature=SCb6VF3skjiX53iZRLIdkwC8ulJFfqJdJSdlvvs2bJ-paNyQUj-6TNxgX~hgVe9~3EAFI80XQgw31dvrpyKni~woTQ8tD749wMuAYonaJvtJ7GFSWAQHwmHCwh9~ZkT8H64b1MynCBIIMReqfS2BvJ~SYEt4BHq6HYhUIq1VIb5G~iASgpJF4hsz9NahzgZUVZuzawnh7eKkBGrQzHc3D4aUZYwNnDEIwrXYz3vrIelnAcl6XdfkzL8-tBaiLxiXwQOBM-1W7~RWwa7CoFyrGyoZNyjsX2JzUiaNFQxkXTdlNWbJChspH4N2lLfftje2WiDg4yEEMXEedu0BFoUvvQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K3HA2TLE2QH99V","cover":"https://thwztvideo.dramaboxdb.com/34/0x3/03x8/038x3/03830000024/700237943_1/700237943.mp4.jpg@w=100&h=135","duration":192990,"price":0},{"id":"700237944","index":1,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/44/0x3/03x8/038x3/03830